---
import '../styles/portfolio-process.css';
---

<section class="pp-section" id="proceso" aria-labelledby="process-heading">
  <div class="pp-layout">
    <div class="pp-intro">
      <h2 id="process-heading">Cómo trabajo<span>.</span></h2>
      <p class="pp-intro-copy">Cuatro etapas, de la idea a la web.</p>

      <nav class="pp-step-nav" aria-label="Etapas del proceso de trabajo">
        <a href="#pp-escuchar"><span>01</span><span class="pp-sr-only"> Entrevista y brief</span></a>
        <a href="#pp-ordenar"><span>02</span><span class="pp-sr-only"> Mapa y bocetos</span></a>
        <a href="#pp-disenar"><span>03</span><span class="pp-sr-only"> Mockup y prototipo</span></a>
        <a href="#pp-construir"><span>04</span><span class="pp-sr-only"> Web adaptable</span></a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="pp-journey">
      <ol class="pp-stages">
        <li class="pp-stage" id="pp-escuchar">
          <div class="pp-stage-top"><span class="pp-stage-number">01</span><span class="pp-stage-verb">Escuchar</span><span class="pp-stage-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↘</span></div>
          <div class="pp-stage-body">
            <div class="pp-stage-copy">
              <h3>Entrevista y brief</h3>
              <p>Definimos qué necesita tu negocio y qué debe lograr la web.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-art pp-art-brief" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="pp-brief-sheet">
                <span class="pp-art-label">EL PUNTO DE PARTIDA</span>
                <strong>Tu idea.</strong>
                <span class="pp-brief-line"></span>
                <span class="pp-brief-question"><i>01</i> ¿A quién ayudas?</span>
                <span class="pp-brief-question"><i>02</i> ¿Qué te hace diferente?</span>
                <span class="pp-brief-question"><i>03</i> ¿Qué quieres lograr?</span>
              </div>
              <span class="pp-brief-check">✓</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="pp-stage" id="pp-ordenar">
          <div class="pp-stage-top"><span class="pp-stage-number">02</span><span class="pp-stage-verb">Ordenar</span><span class="pp-stage-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↘</span></div>
          <div class="pp-stage-body">
            <div class="pp-stage-copy">
              <h3>Mapa y bocetos</h3>
              <p>Ordeno el contenido y preparo bocetos para revisar el recorrido.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-art pp-art-wireframe" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="pp-wireframe">
                <div class="pp-wire-nav"><i></i><span></span><span></span></div>
                <div class="pp-wire-hero"><span><i></i><i></i><b></b></span><span class="pp-wire-image"><i></i></span></div>
                <div class="pp-wire-cards"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              </div>
              <span class="pp-wire-note">Primero, el recorrido.</span>
              <span class="pp-wire-cursor">↖</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="pp-stage" id="pp-disenar">
          <div class="pp-stage-top"><span class="pp-stage-number">03</span><span class="pp-stage-verb">Diseñar</span><span class="pp-stage-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↘</span></div>
          <div class="pp-stage-body">
            <div class="pp-stage-copy">
              <h3>Mockup y prototipo</h3>
              <p>Diseño las pantallas y un prototipo para que puedas revisarlo.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-art pp-art-prototype" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="pp-design-card">
                <span class="pp-art-label">DIRECCIÓN VISUAL</span>
                <strong>Aa<span>.</span></strong>
                <div class="pp-design-palette"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
                <div class="pp-design-bottom"><span>Forma + intención</span><i>↗</i></div>
                <span class="pp-design-handle pp-handle-one"></span><span class="pp-design-handle pp-handle-two"></span><span class="pp-design-handle pp-handle-three"></span><span class="pp-design-handle pp-handle-four"></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li class="pp-stage" id="pp-construir">
          <div class="pp-stage-top"><span class="pp-stage-number">04</span><span class="pp-stage-verb">Construir</span><span class="pp-stage-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
          <div class="pp-stage-body">
            <div class="pp-stage-copy">
              <h3>Web adaptable</h3>
              <p>Desarrollo la web y reviso su funcionamiento en móvil y escritorio.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-art pp-art-devices" aria-hidden="true">
              <div class="pp-desktop"><div class="pp-device-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="pp-device-screen"><span class="pp-device-title"></span><span class="pp-device-line"></span><span class="pp-device-button"></span><span class="pp-device-orbit"></span></div></div>
              <div class="pp-tablet"><span class="pp-device-title"></span><span class="pp-device-line"></span><span class="pp-device-button"></span></div>
              <div class="pp-phone"><i></i><span class="pp-device-title"></span><span class="pp-device-line"></span><span class="pp-device-button"></span></div>
              <span class="pp-device-caption">La misma idea. En cada pantalla.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <a class="pp-example" href="/proyectos/senda-cafe/#proceso">
        <span class="pp-example-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        <span><strong>El proceso de Senda Café</strong></span>
        <span class="pp-example-link">Ver caso <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
